            "id": "btzkwuqv1",
            "title": "Craft Museum",
            "name": "Craft Museum",
            "desc": "The National Handicrafts and Handlooms Museum, popularly known as Crafts Museum displays India\u0092s rich tradition of handicrafts. An attraction of the museum is the presence of craftsmen, who come from different parts of the country to demonstrate their skills. The museum posesses the most exceptional and superb pieces of art and craft, specially the textiles selectively collected from all over the country. The Museum was established in 1956, as a project to show the works of indigenous artisans in one place. By the early 1980\u0092s, over 20,000 objects had been collected. Constructed with mud the numerous huts are beautifully decorated with folk art and exhibits include",
            "img": "/state-images/Delhi/d_084.webp",
