              "id": "af3072fa",
              "name": "Nati",
              "desc": "Community dance during festivals & social occasions. Nati is a traditional folk dance of Himachal Pradesh, India. It is performed slowly by revolving around in a circular motion with hand-in-hand steps. Though this dance is rooted in every Himachali\u2019s soul, it is primarily performed at weddings, cultural festivals, and harvest celebrations.",
