            "title": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Paitkar Paintings",
            "name": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Paitkar Paintings",
            "desc": "A form of painting famous from Jharkhand is a special type of painting called the paitkar paintings. This form of painting is one of the earliest forms of tribal paintings in India. These paintings have the look of a scroll on which life after death is depicted. It is unfortunate that, due to lack of recognition and promotion, this type of painting is slowly facing extinction.",
