          {
            "id": "pexvfmlef",
            "title": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Masks",
            "name": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Masks",
            "desc": "Chhou is a type of dance done with colourful masks. The mask is made of papier mache in Singhbhum district of Jharkhand. These dancers use colourful, big sized and decorative masks. The masks are bright in colour and the details are stylised.",
