            "title": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Bamboo Craft",
            "name": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Bamboo Craft",
            "desc": "The forests of Jharkhand have a good quality, thin but strong and flexible bamboo. Such bamboo is used by the artisans for making different items out of the bamboo, such as fishing equipments, baskets, containers, hunting equipments and fishing gears are made.",
            "img": "/state-images-new/Jharkhand/82952a8d058b64cfe5532e2a5801b5c8.jpg",
