            "title": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Toy Making",
            "name": "Jharkhand \u0096 Handicrafts- Toy Making",
            "desc": "Toupadana near the capital city of Ranchi is famous for some unusual wooden toys that are completely abstract. They are just pieces of wood painted to look like human figures with angular lines but no separate limbs. Hands are indicated only by painting lines on the body. The toys are always in pairs showing man and woman wearing different crowns, costumes and ornaments.",
