      "facts": [
        "**Hand-Embroidery**: Hand embroidery is a popular craft practiced by both men and women in Manipur. There are about ten different varieties of embroidery designs in which they generally make tablecloths, bed-covers, shawls, handkerchiefs etc. Prominent legendry figures and animal motifs are stitched with perfection."
