          "title": "Gangaikondacholapuram-  Brihadeshwara Temple - A sculpture of Dvarapalaka (guardian of the entrance). The emotion it evokes\u2014fear. Does it not look scary? This sculpture in Bhayanaka rasa is meant to scare off the negative forces. https://ncert.nic.in/textbook.php?gekr1=1-20 Cl-7 Ch 1 Kriti",
