        {
          "id": "c5f4f411",
          "name": "Kumbakonam Botel Leaf: Aromatic agricultural leaf recognized for quality and taste\nThovalai Flower Garland: Garlands made from fragrant local flowers. \nPanruti Cashew: Cashew variety with rich flavor\nPanruti Palappezham (Jackfruit): Local jackfruil variety with distinctive sweetneas.\nChetfikulam Small Onion: Smail union with strong flavor profile.\nPutiyangudi Acid Lime: Tangy lime used in culinary dishes. \nVirudhunagar Samha Vathal: lentli lentili snack, typical of local\nRamanadu Chithiraikar Rice: Traditional aromatic rice variety.\nWoralyur Cotton Seart: Handwoven cofton sari with classic motife.\nThooyamalli Rice: Local aromatic rice.\nKavindapadi Nattu Sakarai: Traditional jaggery from sugarcane.\nNamakkal Kalchatti: Earthen coking enhancing flavor and beat retention.\nAmhasamudram Choppu Saman: Traditional wooden ulensis and tools."
        }
      ]
