          "name": "Banarasi Shobnal: Traditional wind instrument vital to classical and ceremonial music.\nBanarasi Tahta: Handcrafted classical percussion instrument.\nMeerut Bugle: Brass wind instrument used in ceremonies and bands.\nMathura Zari Dress: Garment with metallic threadwork and intricate designs."
