    {
      "name": "In the North East, Assam has\nMelodies Like Ei Maatire\nMoro Mote\nLet us Learn the song.\nLanguage: Assamese\nEi Maatire Moro Mote",
      "desc_link": "https://ncert.nic.in/textbook.php?fekr1=9-22 cl-6 ch 9",
      "artists": "An outstanding musician was born in Sadiya, Assam in the year 1926 whose name was Bhupen Hazarika. He was a playback singer, lyricist, musician, poet, actor, artist, editor, filmmaker and educationist widely known as Sudha Kontho. He used music as an \u2018instrument of social change\u2019 and composed inspiring songs. He is a recipient of many national awards including the Bharat Ratna, Dadasaheb Phalke Award and Sangeet Natak Akademi.",
