      "story": "Ashok symbol and its feature",
      "img": "",
      "insights": "Puppetry Trivia\n\u2022 Indian kings like Krishnadevaraya and Vikramaditya were so fond of puppetry, they had their own special theatres for these amazing shows.\n\u2022 Puppetry can be an effective method to create awareness among the students on values such as gender sensitivity as well as awareness on safe and unsafe touch.\n\u2022 Today, Indian puppetry keeps the tradition alive by bringing in new techniques and technologies to make it even more exciting. \n(Ref: NCERT Textbook fekr1, Ch. 19)"
